    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is still in development.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive with your friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561610/extras/e0f3576aa3035bcf32b9bf792c3a6a55.poster.avif?t=1741140296\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561610/extras/e0f3576aa3035bcf32b9bf792c3a6a55.webm?t=1741140296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561610/extras/e0f3576aa3035bcf32b9bf792c3a6a55.mp4?t=1741140296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horde Arena is an intense survival game where you must withstand endless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a basic character and choose from four unique classes to shape your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money by defeating enemies, then use it to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase stat-enhancing items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class has two powerful final evolutions\u2014choose wisely and dominate the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During break time between waves, spin the roulette and test your luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, and may you survive the horde!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is still in development.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive with your friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561610/extras/e0f3576aa3035bcf32b9bf792c3a6a55.poster.avif?t=1741140296\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561610/extras/e0f3576aa3035bcf32b9bf792c3a6a55.webm?t=1741140296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561610/extras/e0f3576aa3035bcf32b9bf792c3a6a55.mp4?t=1741140296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horde Arena is an intense survival game where you must withstand endless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a basic character and choose from four unique classes to shape your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money by defeating enemies, then use it to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase stat-enhancing items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class has two powerful final evolutions\u2014choose wisely and dominate the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During break time between waves, spin the roulette and test your luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, and may you survive the horde!</p>",
